9	/**
10	 * Inject a <system-reminder> message into the conversation.
11	 * - wake=false: while streaming, steered in before the next LLM call; while idle, appended to the
12	 *   session immediately (seen with the next prompt). Never starts a turn.
13	 * - wake=true: while streaming, delivered as a follow-up; while idle, starts a new turn
14	 *   (e.g. a background task finished).
