2	 * Replay scripted scenarios against Claude Code (via @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk) and pi-claude,
3	 * then report the differences.
4	 *
5	 *   npx tsx parity/run.ts [--only name1,name2] [--out parity/out] [--model claude-sonnet-4-6]
6	 */
