145	
146	## When to Use This Tool
147	
148	**Mark tasks as resolved:**
149	- When you have completed the work described in a task
150	- When a task is no longer needed or has been superseded
151	- IMPORTANT: Always mark your assigned tasks as resolved when you finish them
